Explanation
DeadReckon refused to start a nested campaign because depth cap 2 reached.
This is a controlled recursion guard; use an orchestrated full-plan inside the sub-orchestrator instead of starting another campaign coordinator.

Evidence
goal: nested campaign
current depth: 1
depth cap: 2
requested subs: 2
reason: sub-orchestrators cannot campaign again

Recommended
deadreckon orchestrate full-plan "nested campaign" --n 2 --planner-provider smoke --provider smoke

